Subject: [PATCH 022/138] dt-bindings: clock: Add the Apple A8 touch clock

The PMGR of the Apple A8 (t7000) has a TOUCH_CTL register that gates and
divides the 24 MHz reference clock down to the 32.768 kHz clock the
multi-touch controller needs. Describe it as a child of the PMGR.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
